  "constructionChanges": [
    "Shared hafu crown raised0.17m and shoulders0.52m, main ridge raised0.22m, lower transfer raised0.18m. Roof, board, fascia, rafters and bearing geometry rebuild from the common profile; no camera/global-group stretch.",
    "Mass164 round columns, deep0.80m main transfers and rear bearing assemblies retained. Four new full-depth cloud knees have real seated top faces on the actual transverse-carrier grid, rather than tilted box-end approximations.",
    "Largest repeated generated gilt slabs and blade-like reveal leaves replaced by whole exact source157 peony and source176 cloud geometry. Source157 original normals, triangles and intrinsic sculptural depth retained; only rigid orientation/recentering and uniform fitting. Four actual routed depressions in the solid transfer timber receive source floral fields. Closed returned carrier/rim geometry remains at stile/reveal locations that require it.",
    "Repeated mirrored triangular crowns from R01 reduced to selected single carved shoulders. Main door stiles have deep recessed fields and edge returns; actual complete source floral fields occupy the two full-depth reveal walls and the inner shrine back.",
    "Generic authored Buddha replaced by compact ORIGINAL unpaired Scan-the-World Japanese Amida179, including its original rectangular plinth. No paired-arm derivative, fingertip edits, plinth separation, anatomy deformation, normal recomputation or source-index changes. Original +Y-up/+Z-front axes retained; positive uniform1.60m scene fitting only.",
    "Closed shrine pedestal fills old0.55m unsupported gap; cabinet posts and ritual table feet reach actual hall floor. Original scan plinth seats on local altarY1.065 inside1.80x1.13m core; a separate supported lacquer/gilt cornice encloses its pale slab without altering source anatomy/plinth.",
    "Shrine receded0.9m. Six modeled oil flames feed two real shadowed clustered lamps; unmatched extra fill points removed. Doorway solid angle limits only indirect sky. A separate actual256px room probe supplies local metal reflection and skips a second specular sky mask. Exterior lantern materials are separated from shrine materials.",
    "Suspended lamps raised0.15m to reference height, with120 actual pierced metal lattice rings and ray-measured supports. Tower whole position/scale/tiers/roof silhouette held; nineteen slender closed finial discs replace the wide wire spring."
  ],
